333:    * That is, adding a subsequent handler for the same type will replace the previous.
334:    *
335:    * @param action the specification of how to handle the request based on the clients preference of content type
336:    * @throws Exception any thrown by action
337:    */
338:   void byContent(Action<? super ByContentSpec> action) throws Exception;
